# Redirects. Read by BOTH Netlify and Cloudflare Pages.
#
# There is deliberately NO language redirect here. Cloudflare Pages cannot do
# conditional redirects at all, and on Netlify the rule was only ever a
# fallback: the gate page at "/" (src/pages/index.astro) does the negotiation,
# and does it better, because it can read the visitor's saved choice from
# localStorage. Accept-Language is a guess about a browser; wcc-lang is a
# decision the reader actually made, and the decision has to win. With no JS
# the gate is still a real page with the address and the service time on it.

# Legacy Squarespace URLs -> their new homes, so years of existing links,
# bookmarks and search results keep working.
/home            /en           301
/about           /en/about     301
/sermons         /en/sermons   301
/fellowship      /en/community 301
/new-page        /en/community 301
